],"I disagree. It\u0027s difficult, however it\u0027s possible.":[71.777,5.384],"Interesting! Is it better to study alone or in a group?":[77.611,4.974],"It depends. On the other hand, a group is more fun.":[83.035,5.449],"You\u0027re a great debater! Well done!":[88.934,3.724]}}